Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:55.29,Hook,,0,0,0,,YO SÍ DIGO LAS COSAS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:01.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Yo sí digo las cosas de\Nuna vez, wey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.10,0:00:04.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Pero conozco a alguien, no\Ndiré quién... Tiara
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.30,0:00:04.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}se llama,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:06.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}que sí es así, wey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.82,0:00:10.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Y yo la regaño a Tiara,\Nwey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:11.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}La he regañado varias\Nveces porque...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.92,0:00:12.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}le digo:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.98,0:00:13.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}«¿Y esto?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.42,0:00:13.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Cuánto te costó?»
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.22,0:00:14.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Y me dice el precio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:16.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Y le digo:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.14,0:00:16.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}«¿Pero por qué?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.36,0:00:18.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Por qué compraste esto?»
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.92,0:00:19.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Y me dice:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.72,0:00:21.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}«Pues es que ya me dio\Nvergüenza y ya lo pagué».
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.94,0:00:23.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Y de hecho me quedaba un\Npoco chica,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.28,0:00:26.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}pero bueno...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.18,0:00:28.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Al final sí fui a\Nreembolsarlo, pero me\Ntrató feo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.46,0:00:28.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}la vieja.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.23,0:00:33.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—¿Estás hablando de la vez\Nque me pediste que yo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.53,0:00:34.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}fuera a reembolsar por ti?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.71,0:00:37.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ok, tú no fuiste a\Nreembolsar nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.37,0:00:37.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Yo fui.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.41,0:00:38.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Vale?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.99,0:00:40.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—Sí, sí... la de las\Nlentillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.13,0:00:43.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—Yo fui a reembolsar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.57,0:00:45.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Tú me acompañaste nada\Nmás.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.11,0:00:47.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Fue tu compra, pero yo...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.27,0:00:48.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—¡Pero hice acto de\Npresencia!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.47,0:00:52.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—Sí, tipo, te paraste\Natrás de mí mientras yo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.39,0:00:52.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}decía todo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.19,0:00:54.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—Sí, es verdad, mi amor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.01,0:00:55.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Es verdad.
